only. It does not cover the neuroimaging data or the assets derived from it:
everything under data/, public/models/ and public/diffusion/ stays under the
terms of its origin, listed in README.md and docs/reference/references.md, with
the full texts in public/models/licenses/. Those terms include the FreeSurfer
